<div data-ob-island="refund"><div class="min-h-screen bg-background"><main><section class="bg-foreground py-14 md:py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6"><p class="font-jost text-[13px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.7px] text-white/60">Legal</p><h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-[32px] font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-[48px]">Returns &amp; Refunds Policy</h1></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] px-6 pt-10 pb-4"><p class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">This Returns &amp; Refunds Policy explains how Online Blinds Express handles damaged goods, faulty items, replacements, cancellations, and refunds for made-to-measure blinds.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-[860px] px-6 pb-16 pt-4"><div class="divide-y divide-border"><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Reporting Damaged or Defective Goods</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>All items are quality checked before dispatch, but please inspect your order as soon as it arrives. Damage or defects caused by manufacturing or transit must be reported within <strong>3 working days</strong> of delivery.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">How to Report an Issue</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Email <a href="mailto:sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk">sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk</a> with your order details and a clear description of the issue. We aim to respond within <strong>1 working day</strong>, and no later than <strong>3 working days</strong>.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Claim Investigation</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Please do not fit or install the blind while your claim is being reviewed. We may ask for photographs, further details, or the return of the product for inspection before confirming the outcome.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Original Packaging</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Please keep all original packaging until your order has been checked. If packaging has been disposed of and replacement packaging is needed for a return or inspection, additional packaging charges may apply.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Replacements</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>If our investigation confirms a manufacturing fault or transit damage, we will provide a like-for-like replacement for the affected made-to-measure product.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Replacement Changes</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Replacement orders must match the original order. We cannot change measurements, colours, fabrics, controls, or other specifications as part of a replacement.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Returning Faulty Items</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>If a return is required after our investigation, faulty items must be returned within <strong>30 days</strong> of return approval and must meet the criteria confirmed during the claim review.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Cancellations</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Because our blinds are made to your exact specifications, orders cannot be changed or cancelled once they have entered production.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Refunds</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>If an item is discontinued or out of stock before manufacturing begins, we will notify you and issue a full refund. We may also cancel and refund an order due to non-payment, discontinued stock, refusal to cover applicable delivery costs, pricing errors, or internal system errors.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Delivery and Failed Delivery</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Blinds are typically manufactured within <strong>3-5 working days</strong> and dispatched after production. Deliveries usually take place Monday to Friday and may require a signature. Multiple failed delivery attempts may incur re-delivery charges. Items returned to us by the courier will be held for <strong>4 weeks</strong> before disposal.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Warranty</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Our blinds are backed by a <strong>5-year warranty</strong> against manufacturing defects on components and fabrics. This warranty does not cover fair wear and tear, misuse, accidental damage, alterations, fading caused by prolonged sunlight exposure, incorrect installation, or commercial use.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Technical Specifications</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>Please allow for a machine manufacturing tolerance of <strong>+/- 4mm</strong> on all blinds, or up to<!-- --> <strong>+/- 6mm</strong> depending on fabric type. Large Day &amp; Night blinds over <strong>1800mm</strong> wide may show a slight wave in the fabric due to size and fabric weight restrictions.</p></div></div><div class="py-8"><h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-[20px] font-semibold text-foreground md:text-[22px]">Contact</h2><div class="font-jost text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted [&amp;_a]:text-primary [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a:hover]:text-primary/80 [&amp;_p+p]:mt-3"><p>For returns or refund questions, please email<!-- --> <a href="mailto:sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk">sales@onlineblindsexpress.co.uk</a>.</p><p>Response time: <strong>1-3 working days</strong>.</p></div></div></div></section></main></div></div>